<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Bidvest year shr up, div rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bidvest year shr up, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - diluted		 132.5	 vs 105.8</p>
<p>    - undiluted	     157.0	 vs 149.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 70.9	  vs 56.1</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   228.46	vs 170.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   308.52	vs 216.83</p>
<p>    Tax			 76.44	 vs 47.84</p>
<p>    Net finance income    22.99 gain  vs 2.70 cost</p>
<p>    Turnover		  5,069.95    vs 4,166.68</p>
<p>Div payable September 19</p>
<p>on register September 5</p>
<p>Full name: Bidvest Group</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said in a statement it expected to achieve improved earnings growth in real terms in the year due to its position in growth industries.</p>
<p>The firm also said it was highly liquid and would continue to seek further acquisitions to add value.</p>
